-> Smart Artisan Assistant

JPMC Code for Good Hackathon
Empowering artisans with simple digital tools and AI-driven guidance.


-> Problem Statement
Over 200 million artisans in India manage their entire business — production, materials, payments, and quality — using notebooks and WhatsApp. This makes it nearly impossible to track earnings accurately, resolve payment disputes, plan for growth, or get feedback on product quality.
Smart Artisan Assistant bridges this gap with two focused digital products built specifically for artisan needs.

AI Features
Image Analysis-> Artisan uploads a product photo → AI estimates price range and flags visible defects

-> Impact

Replaces unreliable notebooks and WhatsApp with a structured digital system
Gives artisans visibility into whether they are actually profitable
Reduces payment disputes with a shared, tamper-proof ledger
Provides quality feedback before products are rejected by buyers
Designed for low-tech familiarity — large fonts, simple flows, regional language support planned
